      {
        "id": 223118,
        "name": "VGBM",
        "username": "VGBM",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vgbm/{size}/2020_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-10-13T04:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the problem is the potential to abuse the initiative system on both sides. The near-double turn strategy is more of a backup to my main plan, which is simply to inform the players that they should be thinking about who the&nbsp;writer wants to pass the turn to instead of the&nbsp;character.</p>",
